<section class="dynamic-page faq-section"><div><div class="section-kicker">GOOD THINGS TO KNOW</div><h1>Questions?<br/><span class="serif">We’ve got you.</span></h1><p>Still curious? <a href="mailto:hello@abroadmates.com">Say hello ↗</a></p></div><div class="faq-list"><details open><summary>What is AbroadMates?<span>+</span></summary><p>We connect students planning to study abroad with current students who can share first-hand advice about schools, applications, scholarships, and life in a new country.</p></details><details><summary>How does a mentorship call work?<span>+</span></summary><p>Choose a mentor, pick a 20 or 40 minute plan and a time that works, then bring your questions.</p></details><details><summary>Who are the mentors?<span>+</span></summary><p>Current students and graduates with first-hand experience applying to and studying at universities around the world.</p></details><details><summary>How much does it cost?<span>+</span></summary><p>Mentors set transparent prices for their calls. The price is displayed before you book.</p></details></div></section>
